  m_Name: GItem_AutoTreeFarm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_autotreefarm
  displayName: Grid Automatic Tree Farm
  description: Ship-mounted automated arboricultural gantry. Continuously cultivates
    and fells trees into Wood Logs, Biomass, Wood Chips, and surplus Saplings using
    grid power (120 W), piped water from connected grid liquid tanks, and breathable
    air. Self-reseeds automatically, accepts Biomass/Organic Fertilizer for +45%
    speed and bonus timber, takes 2 Speed/Efficiency upgrade modules, and pushes
    timber into connected grid cargo.
